    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "737\nSafety\nSicherheit\nSeguridad\nSécurite\n200",
      "WATER LANDING\nNotlandung auf dem Wasser\namaraje\namerissage\n*ńi·₺\nPLEASE KEEP YOUR SEATBELT FASTENED\nAT ALL TIMES WHEN IN YOUR SEAT.\nALL CARRY ON ITEMS MUST BE PLACED\nUNDER A SEAT OR IN AN OVERHEAD\nCOMPARTMENT.\nNO SMOKING IN THE NON-SMOKING SEATS,\nIN THE AISLE AND THE LAVATORIES.\nYOUR CO-OPERATION WILL BE\nAPPRECIATED.\n©1988 PIEDMONT AVIATION INC.\nSUBSIDIARY OF USAir GROUP •\nDESIGNED BY R.L. REID \u0026 CO., INC GREENSBORO, NC\nPA-P-652",
      "PLEASE REVIEW BEFORE TAKE-OFF.\nOXYGEN\nSauerstoff\noxígeno\noxygene\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE THIS FOLDER FROM AIRCRAFT.\nBRACE POSITIONS\nSchutzhaltungen\nposiciones de aterrizaje forzoso\npositions d'aterrisage force\nSEAT BELTS\nSitzgurte\ncinturones de seguridad\nceintures de sûreté\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nNotausgange\nsalidas de emergencia\nsorties d'urgence\n#*1\nSEAT CUSHIONS\nSitzkissen\ncojines de asiento\ncoussins de siege\n1\n2\n3\n2\nDOORS\nTüren\npuertas\nportières\nFT\n1\nROTATE\n2\nPULL IN\nWINDOWS\nFenster\nventanillas\nhublots\n2 IN\n1DOWN\n3\n4\nPULL\n3\nPUSH\n4\nOUT"
